      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For build and test one thing that would need to go along with this, is have the client copy the avatar from the local test folder. Right now I believe VRChat client keeps the vrca file open. So when I'm using a test avatar and rebuild it while wearing it, the new build doesn't seem to work properly",
